{"video":"ZFXGxlqd9B0","lines":[{"t":[0,3],"en":"- Hey, everybody. Happy Thanksgiving!"},{"t":[3,5],"en":"- Shh! - No, no, no, no, no, no."},{"t":[5,8],"en":"What, are we keeping Thanksgiving a secret this year?"},{"t":[8,10],"en":"- No, we were playing this game I learned at work."},{"t":[10,13],"en":"You have to name all the states in six minutes."},{"t":[13,15],"en":"- What? That's, like, insanely easy."},{"t":[15,17],"en":"- No, it's a lot harder than it sounds."},{"t":[17,19],"en":"You always forget at least one."},{"t":[19,22],"en":"Or in some cases, 14."},{"t":[22,24],"en":"- It's a stupid game,"},{"t":[24,26],"en":"and I wasn't playing against other people,"},{"t":[26,27],"en":"so technically I didn't lose."},{"t":[27,30],"en":"- What? You forgot 14 states?"},{"t":[30,33],"en":"- Nobody cares about the Dakotas!"},{"t":[33,35],"en":"- Oh, okay, time's up."},{"t":[35,37],"en":"- All right, I got 48."},{"t":[37,38],"en":"- Oh, that's not bad. Phoebe?"},{"t":[38,40],"en":"- Oh, I got tired of naming states,"},{"t":[40,44],"en":"so I decided to list the types of celery."},{"t":[44,47],"en":"And I have one, regular celery."},{"t":[47,49],"en":"- Okay, so Rachel's got 48,"},{"t":[49,52],"en":"and Phoebe has the lead in..."},{"t":[52,54],"en":"vegetables."},{"t":[54,55],"en":"Joey?"},{"t":[55,57],"en":"- Say hello to the new champ"},{"t":[57,59],"en":"of Chandler's dumb states game."},{"t":[59,61],"en":"- Well, how many you got?"},{"t":[61,62],"en":"- 56."},{"t":[66,67],"en":"- Done."},{"t":[67,69],"en":"With time to spare."},{"t":[69,72],"en":"- Ooh, this may be a new world's record."},{"t":[72,74],"en":"- You know, I hate to lecture you guys,"},{"t":[74,75],"en":"but it's kind of disgraceful"},{"t":[75,78],"en":"that a group of well-educated adults"},{"t":[78,80],"en":"and Joey..."},{"t":[80,83],"en":"can't name all the states."},{"t":[83,84],"en":"You ever see a map?"},{"t":[84,86],"en":"Or one of those round, colorful things"},{"t":[86,87],"en":"called a globe?"},{"t":[87,88],"en":"Hmm?"},{"t":[88,90],"en":"- Uh, Magellan?"},{"t":[90,92],"en":"You got 46 states."},{"t":[92,93],"en":"- What?"},{"t":[93,95],"en":"That's impossible."},{"t":[95,96],"en":"- 46."},{"t":[96,98],"en":"Well, who's well-educated now,"},{"t":[98,100],"en":"Mr. I-forgot-10 states?"},{"t":[100,101],"en":"- Okay, Ross, time is up."},{"t":[101,103],"en":"- No, just give me another minute."},{"t":[103,104],"en":"- Look, Ross, if you don't know them by now,"},{"t":[104,106],"en":"you will never know them, okay?"},{"t":[106,107],"en":"That is the beauty of this game."},{"t":[107,110],"en":"It makes you want to kill yourself."},{"t":[110,112],"en":"- This is crazy."},{"t":[112,113],"en":"I can do this."},{"t":[113,116],"en":"All right, uh, I bet I can get all 50 before dinner."},{"t":[116,119],"en":"- Okay, but if you can't, no dinner."},{"t":[119,120],"en":"- You're on."},{"t":[120,122],"en":"- All right, don't look at my list, Ross,"},{"t":[122,124],"en":"'cause there's a lot on there that you don't have."},{"t":[128,130],"en":"- How can I not get this?"},{"t":[130,131],"en":"I'm a college professor."},{"t":[131,134],"en":"I got $14.50 on my SATs."},{"t":[134,136],"en":"- $12.50."},{"t":[136,139],"en":"- Damn, I forgot you were here."},{"t":[139,141],"en":"- Ross, you need some help?"},{"t":[141,143],"en":"- From you?"},{"t":[143,145],"en":"- Yes, please."},{"t":[151,154],"en":"- First of all, Utah?"},{"t":[154,156],"en":"Dude, you can't just make stuff up."},{"t":[163,165],"en":"- I hate America."},{"t":[166,168],"en":"When I finish this game, I swear I am moving."},{"t":[171,173],"en":"Okay, maybe this is so hard,"},{"t":[173,176],"en":"because there aren't 50 states."},{"t":[178,179],"en":"Let me tell you something."},{"t":[179,181],"en":"I have 49 states."},{"t":[182,183],"en":"And there are no more!"},{"t":[185,187],"en":"So I think I should be able to eat something."},{"t":[189,190],"en":"- It's up to you."},{"t":[197,202],"en":"I want my turkey now."},{"t":[202,203],"en":"You got it."},{"t":[203,203.1],"en":"You got it."},{"t":[203.1,204],"en":"I know."},{"t":[204,204.1],"en":"You got it."},{"t":[204.1,205],"en":"- I know."},{"t":[205,206],"en":"- Yeah."},{"t":[206,207],"en":"- Yeah."},{"t":[207,208],"en":"-"},{"t":[208,209],"en":"You got it."}]}
